# the flags first, then the verb
$ skills --source-root <WORLD>/skills validate
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: unknown skills verb "<WORLD>/skills" (supported: list, status, validate, install, adopt, add, remove, sync-manifest, lint, approve, project-register, project-revise, project-status, project-retire)

# a flag that takes no part, then the verb
$ skills --frobnicate validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills validate: unknown flag "--frobnicate"

